WEBVTT

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.740
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.590
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:17.800
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.600
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.200
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.620
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.970
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.920
The land of Marmo, ruled by
the dark emperor, Beld...

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:14.020
lies on an evil island
to the south of Lodoss.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.370
The time has come!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.090
At last...

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.510
Highness.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:20.850
All Lodoss will
resound with my power!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.350
By this sword,
I so swear it!

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.650
So shall it be.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.380
Who goes there?!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:44.600
I have come to assist you,
my lord Beld.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.280
Pathetic.
You can barely handle a sword.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.710
Don't worry.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:42.920
Ghim's being quite
gentle with him.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.350
Bloody hell! He couldn't
kill time if he wanted to!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.940
After them!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.060
Don't let a single one escape!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.070
Aye!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:13.370
Pathetic.
You can barely handle a sword.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.740
Don't hurt it just
for your clumsy practice!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.720
You...

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.900
You're that...

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.400
My name is Deedlit.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.340
Deed... lit?

00:05:56.980 --> 00:06:00.300
There are fairies
inside all living things.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.730
Don't you know that?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:14.140
Sorry...
I wasn't thinking.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.390
Oh yeah!

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:20.570
I should thank you.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:21.480
Thank me?

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:27.630
If you hadn't warned us,
the village could've been destroyed.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.070
Thank you.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.160
You really are
a nice guy, aren't you?

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:41.790
Hold!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.300
What are you doing here?!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:59.210
Headstrong, aren't you?

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.270
It's dangerous for you.
Hide!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.720
Dangerous for you,
you mean.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.380
A dark elf!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.160
A what?!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.150
You're no match
for a dark elf!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.110
Worry about
your own hide!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:41.850
Damn.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.120
He's a tough one!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:56.580
You're...!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:02.640
I don't much fancy it,
but either we flee, or else...

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.470
No options now.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:08.090
Yeah.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.380
Parn!

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:18.640
Etoh!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:21.190
What're you
playing here?

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:24.890
I suppose this looks
like "play" to a dwarf?!

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:27.650
Well, I guess kobolds do
make for poor playmates.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.830
What happened?

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:40.660
Some other visitors
have arrived.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.340
Alanian soldiers!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.360
We're saved!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.340
Naive, isn't he?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:55.340
Hey!
What's the big idea?!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.630
Just be patient until the
captain gets back from Alan.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:02.850
Wait! What'd we do?!
HEY!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.600
Save yer breath.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:05.140
Who?!

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:09.040
You can shout all you want,
but if their captain's not here...

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.150
it won't do you
a crumb of good.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.830
Who are you?

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.410
A thief, from the looks of him.

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.680
Looks are about
equal in here.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.320
Well don't assume
we're like you!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:25.450
Well, as I live and breathe!
A lovely little elf wench!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.670
Calm down.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:31.040
When the captain returns, he'll
see this is all a misunderstanding.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:34.670
What?

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.970
Strangers, you say?

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:43.910
Perhaps King Fahn of Valis has
already been alerted. Or else...

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:48.240
The strangers you speak of
are being held in fortress Myce.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.600
You aren't to overlook
the smallest pebble...

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:53.820
which might impede
Emperor Beld's advance.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:59.820
Or is that not your duty as
Captain of the Royal Guard.

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:02.330
It goes without saying.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:09.830
Go forth then, and bring
that fortress to the ground.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.450
The conquest of Shining Hill...

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.940
will bring all of Kannon
under your control, Highness.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:44.220
May Falaris grant us
his divine protection.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.090
His protection won't be needed.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:49.370
I shall take back the power
denied Falaris so long!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.240
So... "Woodchuck..."
How'd you end up in here?

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:21.740
You could say I had
a run of bad luck.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:22.990
"Bad luck?"

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.790
Alania's in for
some bad luck herself.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.310
So I thought I'd build up
my own little war chest...

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:30.470
and then hightail
it to another kingdom.

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:34.030
Falis just wasn't taking
care of me this time.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.460
Falis doesn't grant
protection to thieves!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.060
Oh, I get it.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:43.220
So, Falis is protecting Kannon
and Alania with all his might?

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.720
What's that
supposed to mean?

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:51.250
You don't know?
Troops from Marmo have landed.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:55.320
It's because Alanian troops are
even more unreliable than Kannon's.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.900
This time, I think
I'll slip off to Valis.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:58.900
Valis?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.110
Yeah! You want the strongest
knights in the land...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.000
then you go to Valis!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:19.160
Are these the spies?

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.010
Spies? Us?!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:25.310
We're simply travelers!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:26.630
Some light!

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:30.390
What in?!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:35.900
Lauma adonia moil de Falis.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.140
Moirohs lahm.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.860
You really are
a priest of Falis!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.870
Forgive this
wretched treatment!

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.650
Please.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:01.030
I wish there was some way
I could apologize to you more.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.530
There've been a number
of disturbances lately.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.970
My men are a bit jumpy.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:14.950
If I'd just returned sooner,
this all could have been avoided.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.750
Captain Jebra, please.

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:20.150
Your understanding
is thanks enough.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:24.150
We heard about your troubles
from that fellow, Woodchuck.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.870
"Woodchuck?"
Oh, that thief you mean.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.260
Bloody hell...
Why just me?!

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:36.310
What'd I do
that was so wrong?!

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.880
So, what'd he tell you?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.380
That Beld, the Marmo emperor,
was advancing towards here.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:47.630
True. There's no
saving Kannon, now.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.530
And Alania?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:54.890
We're awaiting the decision from
our king and his chief vassals.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.150
Another war...

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.880
Capt. Jebra!

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.650
We await your inspection!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.880
Very well!
I'll be there shortly!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:27.630
What do you think? They gather
each night to sharpen their skills.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:32.360
Alania has always prized
scholarship above all else.

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:34.830
The men here seem different.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.250
Those who come here are
men with too much strength.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:41.860
People who can't fit
into normal Alanian society.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.620
Keeping all your violent
men in one place, eh?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:45.320
Deedlit...

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.820
No need to apologize.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:58.100
Care to try your hand,
Parn?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.710
Me try it?

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.110
Why not?

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.290
But I...

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.300
You're nowhere near ready!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.300
You'll get more than a
few bruises from these guys!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.760
You can spar with me.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.080
With you, Captain?!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.480
That hot-headed fool!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.160
Seems you've lost a student.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.350
Who has?!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:29.820
Well?

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.030
Not yet!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.030
Look how sloppy he is!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:34.830
Really.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.340
What about it, Parn?

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.300
Why don't you
train yourself here?

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:55.800
You have potential.
And Alania needs strong fighters.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.810
Captain.

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:11.070
Consider my offer.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:21.300
The army.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.720
What's wrong? Slayn!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.840
Slayn!

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:20.720
I know! Sorcery's afoot...
Frighteningly strong sorcery...

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.560
Parn!

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:30.570
A Holy Knight of Valis?!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:35.070
You think they'll
let any fool join them?

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:38.930
I know it's a long shot.
But you said it yourself!

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:40.830
Valis has the best knights.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.510
Yeah, Valis is best.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.510
Kannon and Alania are
full of smart guys...

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:49.370
who couldn't give a
rat's ass about the army.

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:53.200
When you get right down to it,
strength is all that really counts.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.880
Like you said, Valis.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:03.470
Hey! Be a pal and
let me outta here!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:05.310
No more stealing, okay?

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.540
We're under attack!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.780
Hey, come back!
What about me?!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.440
Hold on! I'll come
back for you soon!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:29.750
The dark elf!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:40.470
Deed!

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.160
I'll handle this!
Quickly now!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.470
The castle gates are opening!

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.320
Don't stand
there gawking, lad!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.360
Our enemy seems to have
a sorcerer on their side.

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.340
An extremely powerful one.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.840
Who needs you.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:32.030
Wood!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.440
You son of a bitch!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.750
I thought you said
you'd be back soon!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:37.800
You okay?!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:38.900
'Course I am!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.910
If I bought it in a place like this
I'd never live it down!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.930
You really
came back for me.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.630
Deed!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:56.710
Parn!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.070
Capt. Jebra!

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.290
Etoh! Get over here!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:16.060
What's wrong?

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:18.350
Capt. Jebra!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.770
He's hurt bad.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.070
Save your treatment.

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.360
Captain!

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:31.080
Listen to me. You aren't
soldiers here at Myce.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:34.080
There's no need for you
to lose your lives.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.340
Escape, while you still can.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:37.320
Come with us, then!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.470
I still have a job to do.

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.610
Do you hear me?
Flee!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.180
Captain!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.230
Parn.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.680
Become a worthy knight.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:53.600
Captain!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.610
Parn!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:58.270
Your going with him
won't change anything!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.650
But I can't just...!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.580
Captain... Jebra...

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:56.730
Are you alright?

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:06.960
Capt. Jebra...

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:32.160
Atop the crumbling fortress
stood a man with a gaze like ice.

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.810
In the heart of the boy whose
eyes gazed back in hatred...

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:40.170
the spark of battle
caught fire.

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:56.300
The unstoppable Marmo
forces continue to advance.

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.260
As we head for Valis to
try and halt the invasion...

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.900
we encounter a new obstacle:
Karla, the witch.

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:05.720
What can her
true objective be?!

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.100
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:10.240
"The Gray Witch"

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:13.990
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
